{"id":"61c41873ad1bf93f","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-provable.md","title":"有限证明与可证性","display":"df-provable — 有限证明与可证性","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-provable","aliases":["43-df-provable"],"display":"df-provable — 有限证明与可证性","depends_on":["[[43-df-sentence]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"本目录内建一阶逻辑语法/语义支撑；原书仅预设通常逻辑，未定位到独立对应条目","source_scope":"local-support","verification_status":"formalization-reviewed","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-provable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-provable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-provable — 有限证明与可证性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1be181e56e937ecb\" href=\"?note=1be181e56e937ecb\" title=\"43-df-sentence\">43-df-sentence</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"本目录内建一阶逻辑语法/语义支撑；原书仅预设通常逻辑，未定位到独立对应条目"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"local-support"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"formalization-reviewed"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\operatorname{Lang}_1\">\\(L\\in\\operatorname{Lang}_1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,\\operatorname{Ax}\\subseteq\\operatorname{Sent}_L\">\\(T,\\operatorname{Ax}\\subseteq\\operatorname{Sent}_L\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P=(\\operatorname{Ax},\\operatorname{Rules})\">\\(\\mathcal P=(\\operatorname{Ax},\\operatorname{Rules})\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Rules}\\subseteq\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N}\\{R:R\\subseteq\\operatorname{Sent}_L^k\\times\\operatorname{Sent}_L\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{Rules}\\subseteq\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N}\\{R:R\\subseteq\\operatorname{Sent}_L^k\\times\\operatorname{Sent}_L\\}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\operatorname{Sent}_L\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\operatorname{Sent}_L\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\bigcup_{m\\in\\mathbb N}\\operatorname{Sent}_L^m\">\\(p\\in\\bigcup_{m\\in\\mathbb N}\\operatorname{Sent}_L^m\\)</span>。有限序列采用函数图，索引自然数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span> 同时表示初始段 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{j:j&lt;i\\}\">\\(\\{j:j&lt;i\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Proof}_{T,\\mathcal P}(p,\\varphi)\\iff\\exists m\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\Bigl(p\\in\\operatorname{Sent}_L^{m+1}\\land(m,\\varphi)\\in p\\land\\forall i\\in\\operatorname{dom}(p)\\;\\bigl(p(i)\\in T\\cup\\operatorname{Ax}\\lor\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists R\\in\\operatorname{Rules}\\;\\exists\\bar j\\in i^k\\;(((p(\\bar j(\\ell)))_{\\ell&lt;k},p(i))\\in R)\\bigr)\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Proof}_{T,\\mathcal P}(p,\\varphi)\\iff\\exists m\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\Bigl(p\\in\\operatorname{Sent}_L^{m+1}\\land(m,\\varphi)\\in p\\land\\forall i\\in\\operatorname{dom}(p)\\;\\bigl(p(i)\\in T\\cup\\operatorname{Ax}\\lor\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists R\\in\\operatorname{Rules}\\;\\exists\\bar j\\in i^k\\;(((p(\\bar j(\\ell)))_{\\ell&lt;k},p(i))\\in R)\\bigr)\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"T\\vdash_{\\mathcal P}\\varphi\\iff\\exists p\\in\\bigcup_{m\\in\\mathbb N}\\operatorname{Sent}_L^m\\;\\operatorname{Proof}_{T,\\mathcal P}(p,\\varphi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[T\\vdash_{\\mathcal P}\\varphi\\iff\\exists p\\in\\bigcup_{m\\in\\mathbb N}\\operatorname{Sent}_L^m\\;\\operatorname{Proof}_{T,\\mathcal P}(p,\\varphi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>最后一行用图成员(m,φ)绑定；空序列不能通过正长度条件。每次规则应用的前提索引严格小于当前行，零前提规则允许k=0。可证性始终相对于声明的演算，未将任意规则系统等同于语义后承。</p>\n<p>来源定位沿用附件：本目录内建一阶逻辑语法/语义支撑；原书仅预设通常逻辑，未定位到独立对应条目。本轮核查形式化的内部一致性；未重新核对原书完整证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"1be181e56e937ecb","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-sentence]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"L\\in\\operatorname{Lang}_1","display":false},{"tex":"T,\\operatorname{Ax}\\subseteq\\operatorname{Sent}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P=(\\operatorname{Ax},\\operatorname{Rules})","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Rules}\\subseteq\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N}\\{R:R\\subseteq\\operatorname{Sent}_L^k\\times\\operatorname{Sent}_L\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi\\in\\operatorname{Sent}_L","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in\\bigcup_{m\\in\\mathbb N}\\operatorname{Sent}_L^m","display":false},{"tex":"i","display":false},{"tex":"\\{j:j<i\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Proof}_{T,\\mathcal P}(p,\\varphi)\\iff\\exists m\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\Bigl(p\\in\\operatorname{Sent}_L^{m+1}\\land(m,\\varphi)\\in p\\land\\forall i\\in\\operatorname{dom}(p)\\;\\bigl(p(i)\\in T\\cup\\operatorname{Ax}\\lor\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists R\\in\\operatorname{Rules}\\;\\exists\\bar j\\in i^k\\;(((p(\\bar j(\\ell)))_{\\ell<k},p(i))\\in R)\\bigr)\\Bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"T\\vdash_{\\mathcal P}\\varphi\\iff\\exists p\\in\\bigcup_{m\\in\\mathbb N}\\operatorname{Sent}_L^m\\;\\operatorname{Proof}_{T,\\mathcal P}(p,\\varphi).","display":true}],"bytes":2006,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-493","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-provable]] — 有限证明与可证性"}],"outgoing":["1be181e56e937ecb"]}